y  experimented on by a mad scientist while  imprisoned for a crime he didn't commit  carl lucas used his newfound super  strength and unbreakable skin to  reinvent himself as luke cage together  they are the heroes for hire one of the  only super powered private detective  agencies in the world as marvel's two  premier martial arts heroes it's no  surprise that chongqi is often paired up  with iron fist the two first met in  1976's master of kung fu annual number  one when daniel enlisted shang chi's  help to rescue colleen wing the two  teamed up again in deadly hands of kung  fu number 29 in which a villain  attempted to force the two martial arts  masters to fight to the death hired to  retrieve a statue from the lawless city  of madrapur the heroes for hire  recruited colleen wing wolverine shen  quay and chongqi in 1998's heroes for  hire number 18. together they  successfully retrieved the statue and  foiled a warlord's attempt to conquer  china though the private detective  agency would disband after they returned  to the u.s despite this adventure chi  wouldn't actually meet luke cage until  years later in 2006's black panther  number 11 when the young martial arts  master and luke cage helped save  t'challa from an arranged marriage to  one of shang chi's siblings  when his solo comic book series finally  ended with issue number 125 in 1983  chongqi began a long era in which his  only appearances consisted of cameos and  brief stints on super-powered teams  after working with the heroes for hire  shang-chi found his next superhero team  alongside daredevil though initially a  simple branding initiative featuring  marvel's more street-level superheroes  and adult-oriented stories marvel  knights eventually received its own  self-titled ongoing series it featured a  team of heroes brought together by  daredevil  in order to finally deal with the  murderous vigilante known as the  punisher formed in 2000's marvel knights  number one the initial team included 